      "created_at": "2024-07-23T21:52:40.788Z",
      "cooked": "<p>hello<br>\nI have many Items  one of  items have it’s own tax rate other item use the default tax rate</p>\n<p>for example I have  15 % tax which is the default for all items  and I do not need to choose it in every item<br>\nalso I have one item use  5 % tax so I go to Item data  from tax tab and make the tax 5%</p>\n<p>I add column of tax to my Invoice format as showing in picture<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/9/f9bc9d2afd9965fcfa72be79b942b1bb044b9eaf.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f9bc9d2afd9965fcfa72be79b942b1bb044b9eaf\" title=\"tabletax\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/9/f9bc9d2afd9965fcfa72be79b942b1bb044b9eaf_2_690x267.jpeg\" alt=\"tabletax\" data-base62-sha1=\"zDgZBxUkaPk76oltlOfVal27KzR\" width=\"690\" height=\"267\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/9/f9bc9d2afd9965fcfa72be79b942b1bb044b9eaf_2_690x267.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/9/f9bc9d2afd9965fcfa72be79b942b1bb044b9eaf.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/9/f9bc9d2afd9965fcfa72be79b942b1bb044b9eaf.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F6F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">tabletax</span><span class=\"informations\">807×313 37.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>so in invoice format I multiply   total net amount * 0.15   to get the tax of item  the default  as showing in picture<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1ba534d7950190cc36ed4866a33d5d4ab5f5d2a3.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1ba534d7950190cc36ed4866a33d5d4ab5f5d2a3\" title=\"multiply\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1ba534d7950190cc36ed4866a33d5d4ab5f5d2a3_2_500x500.jpeg\" alt=\"multiply\" data-base62-sha1=\"3WyQnsy6P41fuJMkFnBYks0VvCX\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1ba534d7950190cc36ed4866a33d5d4ab5f5d2a3_2_500x500.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1ba534d7950190cc36ed4866a33d5d4ab5f5d2a3.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1ba534d7950190cc36ed4866a33d5d4ab5f5d2a3.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3F4F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">multiply</span><span class=\"informations\">712×711 62.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Every things will work ok  except if one of item in tables have it’s own different  tax rate</p>\n<p>What Can I do to resolve this problem ,please.</p>",
