      "id": 424025,
      "username": "Praveenkumar",
      "name": "Praveenkumar",
      "created_at": "2024-07-24T02:56:12.077Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Add this condition for tax calculation,<br>\n{% if item.tax %}<br>\n{{ item.amount * item.tax}}<br>\n{%else%}<br>\n{{ item.amount * 0.15}}<br>\n{% endif %}</p>\n<p>item.tax represents the default tax applicable for particular item.</p>",
